---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Engineering leadership × applied AI</p>
      <h1>Building practical <span>agentic systems</span> for complex engineering work.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Yetyellow is an independent workbench for moving from AI strategy to applied practice, with a focus on systems that are useful, accountable and adopted.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button button-primary" href="/now">See current focus</a>
        <a class="text-link" href="/about">About this workbench</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="hero-status" aria-label="Current focus">
      <p class="status-label">[ CURRENT FOCUS ]</p>
      <ol>
        <li><span>01</span> Agent design and evaluation</li>
        <li><span>02</span> Workflow automation</li>
        <li><span>03</span> AI-enabled engineering leadership</li>
      </ol>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <section class="signal-section" aria-labelledby="direction-heading">
    <div class="section-label">01 / Direction</div>
    <div>
      <h2 id="direction-heading">Useful before impressive.</h2>
      <p>Yetyellow starts with the work, not generic claims about AI. The aim is to make agentic systems legible: their purpose, limits, control points and evidence of usefulness.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="principles-section" aria-labelledby="principles-heading">
    <div class="section-heading"><p class="section-label">02 / Working principles</p><h2 id="principles-heading">How the work is approached</h2></div>
    <div class="principles-grid">
      <article><span>01</span><h3>Grounded</h3><p>Start with a specific workflow, constraint and user need.</p></article>
      <article><span>02</span><h3>Accountable</h3><p>Keep human judgement visible where it matters.</p></article>
      <article><span>03</span><h3>Adopted</h3><p>Measure value in changed work, not technical novelty.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="foundation-section" aria-labelledby="foundation-heading">
    <div><p class="section-label">03 / Site status</p><h2 id="foundation-heading">The foundation is the first public artefact.</h2></div>
    <div><p>This site is being built in the open as a disciplined end-to-end project. The first project case study will appear only when it has something real to show.</p><a class="text-link" href="/now">What is being built now</a></div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
